                                                "sense_id": "2c428f17-4b87-3326-82e9-9cd6119dec2a",
                                                "text": "The ends of the veil, drawn over her head, were embroidered with silver; she had long gold ear-rings; to a rich and large gold chain was suspended a cross set with precious stones; and over the arm of her chair hung a rosary of agate beads."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb66baf7-897f-4dba-9e13-b88e9dd2ae80",
                                                "sense_id": "2c428f17-4b87-3326-82e9-9cd6119dec2a",
                                                "text": "Yes: living among the cohabations^([sic]) of Faust himself, among the litharge and agate and hyacinth and pearls."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c492ac2a-c143-3480-a5bd-d4b1f432725f",
                                        "entry_id": "65ef8712-f045-3613-93bc-762b037f4897",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The size of type between pearl and nonpareil, standardized as 5+¹⁄₂-point."
